==Description==
'''Cookie Scout''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from a code. It was obtained from entering the code ''MERRY2024''.

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases the [[Scout]] eating a cookie. When used, it will play a sound effect of a cookie being bitten.

==Trivia==
*The '''Cookie Scout''' sticker is likely based on the [https://knowyourmeme.com/photos/2355535-blue-emoji Blue Emoji Eating Cookie meme].
*This is the only sticker in the game to be obtained using a code.

